Description: anthra skin anthra_1920_OSt for the VDR text2skin plugin
 Full HD (1920x1080) variant OSt of the anthra skin by Tomas Saxer
 for the text2skin plugin of VDR.
 .
 The skin is built from its options in /etc/vdr/anthra/anthra_1920_OSt.conf,
 see vdr-skin-anthra-update(8).
